    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2HPXU6B4NHru3Y4nYCDvp77)_\n\nFollow-up to #311.\n\n## What\n- Removes the 15 `define-obsolete-function-alias` forms (in the `.org` docs and the tangled `.el`) for the `-dryrun` / `-convert` renames.\n- Searched config, docs and tests for the old names: no Elisp calls them, so no function needed rewriting (the remaining matches are mode names such as `sp-bibtex-lint-report-mode` and ERT test names).\n- ADR 0025 and the `sp-org-lint` doc now say the old names are gone; ADR 0024 uses `sp-notes-filing-dryrun`.\n- No CHANGELOG edits.\n\n## Testing\n- Tangle of the docs matches the committed `.el` apart from the intended removals.\n- /untested/ on the Mac and the real vault.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiChZhAssbXCBtA7kMi)_",
